{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4018280/extras/8e2876a3eaad5baa93ef437846bfdfab.avif?t=1761739851\" data-has-big width=1560 height=390 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\ude80 Embark on a Dice Adventure!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your spaceship, roll the dice slot engine, and collect stardust to journey across the stars.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The results of the dice slot engine will determine the amount of stardust you collect!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But if your energy runs out before reaching the next star, your adventure comes to an end!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4018280/extras/b747edd42b349a334217e5076cd46344.poster.avif?t=1761739851\" width=1024 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4018280/extras/b747edd42b349a334217e5076cd46344.webm?t=1761739851\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experiment with hundreds of relics that bend the rules in surprising ways.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enhance your build with enchanting relics that alter mechanics and unlock new synergies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fuse relics into one-of-a-kind combinations, pushing strategies toward infinite variety.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4018280/extras/4b6543ec9282fff11745710a7782df30.poster.avif?t=1761739851\" width=1024 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4018280/extras/4b6543ec9282fff11745710a7782df30.webm?t=1761739851\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfb2 Unleash Dice Power</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Roll across thousands of dice face combinations (number \u00d7 material).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4018280/extras/642ee107ddb971bd172cd163a1d5087c.poster.avif?t=1761739851\" width=1024 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4018280/extras/642ee107ddb971bd172cd163a1d5087c.webm?t=1761739851\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Equip dozens of gems and equipments to overcome diverse challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4018280/extras/a4e6e742f4d8bea37c0bf5e492423628.poster.avif?t=1761739851\" width=1024 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4018280/extras/a4e6e742f4d8bea37c0bf5e492423628.webm?t=1761739851\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\ude90 Explore &amp; Progress</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every star offers a shop to spend Star Coins, powerful relics to discover, and upgrades to unlock.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strengthen your ship with equipment, relics, and gems\u2014each with unique effects that reshape your strategy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4018280/extras/7a4cde4a47d8e51723a6041fd38f8222.avif?t=1761739851\" data-has-big width=1560 height=390 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2728 Endless Replayability</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With diverse level designs, rogue-like progression, and near-infinite build possibilities, no two journeys are the same.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every run is a brand-new space odyssey filled with strategy, creativity, and  surprises.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4018280?t=1761739851","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4018280/33e8633adfd550f4272318c076474a625c5fe138/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1761739851","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4018280/180c9061539751add454478956c41c5056c1ef80/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761739851","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4018280/180c9061539751add454478956c41c5056c1ef80/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761739851","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4018280/extras/8e2876a3eaad5baa93ef437846bfdfab.avif?t=1761739851\" data-has-big width=1560 height=390 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\ude80 Embark on a Dice Adventure!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your spaceship, roll the dice slot engine, and collect stardust to journey across the stars.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The results of the dice slot engine will determine the amount of stardust you collect!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But if your energy runs out before reaching the next star, your adventure comes to an end!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" 