 of gems and equipments to overcome diverse challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4018280/extras/a4e6e742f4d8bea37c0bf5e492423628.poster.avif?t=1761739851\" width=1024 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4018280/extras/a4e6e742f4d8bea37c0bf5e492423628.webm?t=1761739851\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\ude90 Explore &amp; Progress</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every star offers a shop to spend Star Coins, powerful relics to discover, and upgrades to unlock.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strengthen your ship with equipment, relics, and gems\u2014each with unique effects that reshape your strategy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4018280/extras/7a4cde4a47d8e51723a6041fd38f8222.avif?t=1761739851\" data-has-big width=1560 height=390 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2728 Endless Replayability</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With diverse level designs, rogue-like progression, and near-infinite build possibilities, no two journeys are the same.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every run is a brand-new space odyssey filled with strategy, creativity, and  surprises.</p>","developers":["Just L Studio"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4018280/3c1c7e2fe0580cdea050b249d16be10a161de4be/header.jpg?t=1761739851","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<